/**
 * Tamil Nadu district outlines, as SVG paths.
 *
 * Derived once from the district boundary GeoJSON published at
 * github.com/datta07/INDIAN-SHAPEFILES (Survey of India derived, 38 districts
 * including Mayiladuthurai), then simplified with Douglas-Peucker at 0.006
 * degrees — roughly 666m, invisible at the size this renders — and
 * projected to a fixed viewBox.
 *
 * Committed rather than fetched or generated at build time: the boundaries do
 * not change, and a build step would make the page depend on a third-party URL
 * staying up.
 *
 * Names match LAUNCH_DISTRICTS exactly; the source's variants (The Nilgiris,
 * Sivaganga, Tuticorin, Tirupathur) are renamed at generation.
 */
